  "title": "Broadcast wizard launch flow (launchBroadcast)",
  "kind": "callpath",
  "answers": [
    "What happens when a broadcast is launched?",
    "Where is the broadcast wizard logic?",
    "How does the wizard resume a draft?"
  ],
  "body": "`frontend/Broadcasts/broadcastWizardLogic.ts`:\n- Steps: `BROADCAST_WIZARD_STEPS` = recipients, goal, content, schedule, review; `firstInvalidStep` derived from validation errors; `isReadOnly` when status != draft.\n- `buildBroadcastPayload` always sends `status: 'draft'`.\n- `launchBroadcast` listener: save draft → blast-radius preview for confirm token (stop if over batch limit) → PATCH `status:'active'` → create batch job (send now) or schedule (scheduled/recurring) → on failure after activation, PATCH back to `draft`.\n- `loadBroadcastSuccess` + `hydrateFromBroadcast` resume at first invalid step or `review`.",
